visnyk (0.2.0-1) noble; urgency=low

  * Telegram resolve-first send (no address-book pollution), parallel
    WA/TG delivery with per-channel pacing and full FLOOD_WAIT handling.
    Dead-session circuit breaker, background health monitor with cached
    status. Bulk paste auto-tidies numbers into one column. Broadcast
    delivers to all available messengers. Delay 8-15s + jitter, logging
    and history preserved.

 -- Visnyk Team <team@visnyk.local>  Sun, 07 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0200

visnyk (0.1.1-1) noble; urgency=low

  * Direct send: added Send WA and Send TG buttons alongside
    broadcast to all. Direct send targets a single messenger without
    fallback and reports contact not found in WhatsApp/Telegram or
    send failure. Delay 8-15s + jitter, logging and history preserved.
    Broadcast now delivers to all available messengers (was first
    available). History shows multiple channels with "all" indicator.

 -- Visnyk Team <team@visnyk.local>  Fri, 05 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0200

visnyk (0.1.0-1) noble; urgency=low

  * Initial release: broadcast messenger for WA, TG, Viber with Wails,
    encrypted storage.

